Input: {"decision_time_ms": 1789919999999, "macro_contexts": {"D1": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1789862399999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["The window high 2771.00 (1787270400000) is 25 bars old and untouched; price is still below the 2680.00 range high on a closing basis, so the breakout leg remains an attempt inside the range, not accepted structure.", "The last bar was rejected at 2700.00, leaving an upper tail of about 67 points, and the prior 2680.00 attempt (1789084800000) closed roughly 165 points below its high; the same zone has produced two visible sellers' reactions, an incipient double top.", "1789430400000 is a wide bear bar (open 2513.91, low 2358.62, close 2397.10) that erased several bull closes in one bar, showing two-sided trade with bears still able to produce strong bars inside the range.", "A 29-bar overlapping range after a near-vertical spike is equally consistent with a climactic spike followed by distribution; the spike's 2771.00 tail bar closed only at 2515.30, well below its high."], "evidence_for": ["The most recent close 2632.98 is the highest close of the supplied 120 bars, and the last two bars are consecutive bull bars that take out the prior six bars' highs and the 2557.46 inner ceiling.", "Whole-window structure is a bull sequence of higher swing lows (1368.42 -> 1512.91 -> 1551.60 -> 1694.74 -> 2357.18) with the 2358.62 low (1789430400000) holding above 2357.18, so the 29-bar sideways stretch follows a strong bull spike and reads as a bull flag rather than a completed top.", "Range pullbacks have been shallow relative to the 1905.63-2771.00 spike: most range closes stay above the spike's midpoint near 2338, and each push down to the 2357-2395 area has been bought back into the 2440-2530 zone.", "Each successive upper test has closed higher (2514.72 at 1789084800000 versus 2632.98 at 1789776000000), i.e. sellers at 2680-2700 have not produced a lower close or an accepted break back down."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["120 closed D1 bars, first open 2066.43 (1779494400000), last bar open 2612.03 / high 2700 / low 2604.75 / close 2632.98 (close_time_ms 1789862399999).", "Bars 1-15 of the window decline from high 2143.61 (1779494400000) to low 1368.42 (1780704000000); the 1780704000000 bar has range 1368.42-1599.27 and closes 1568.55 in the upper part of that range with a long lower tail.", "Higher lows follow the 1368.42 low: 1512.91 (1782432000000), 1551.60 (1782777600000), 1694.74 (1783296000000); rising highs reach 1959.37 (1785024000000), then ~12 bars overlap between roughly 1820 and 1960 (1785456000000-1787011200000).", "Three-bar bull spike from 1905.63 to 2771.00: opens/closes 1916.51/2252.16, 2252.20/2326.32, 2326.31/2515.30 at 1787097600000, 1787184000000, 1787270400000; the 2771.00 high leaves a large upper tail on the third bar.", "Since 1787356800000 the market has been sideways: 29 bars between low 2357.18 (1788307200000) and spike highs 2680.00 (1789084800000) and 2700.00 (1789776000000), with most closes between roughly 2390 and 2540 and an inner ceiling at 2557.46 (1787788800000).", "Two separate upside spike attempts above that inner ceiling: 1789084800000 (open 2436.83, high 2680.00, close 2514.72, upper tail ~165) and 1789689600000-1789776000000 (close 2612.02, then high 2700.00 with close 2632.98, upper tail ~67).", "1789430400000 is a large bear bar inside the same range: open 2513.91, low 2358.62, close 2397.10, i.e. a wide body closing near its low.", "The last close 2632.98 is the highest close in the supplied 120-bar window, and the 2700.00 high is still below the window high 2771.00."], "phase": "breakout-spike", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Opening bear leg of the window: 15 bars of lower highs and lower lows from 2143.61 into an accelerating sell-off that reaches 1368.42 (1780704000000), where the bar closes at 1568.55 in the upper 72% of its 1368.42-1599.27 range, a long-lower-tail reversal bar.", "end_time_ms": 1780790399999, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1779494400000, "upper_boundary": "2143.61"}, {"description": "Recovery and uptrend from the 1368.42 low: higher lows at 1512.91 (1782432000000) and 1551.60 (1782777600000) with rising highs into 1959.37 (1785024000000), followed by an overlapping ~1820-1960 pause (1785456000000-1787011200000) that holds well above the 1368.42 origin.", "end_time_ms": 1787097599999, "kind": "channel", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1780790400000, "upper_boundary": "1959.37"}, {"description": "Three-bar bull spike: bars at 1787097600000, 1787184000000 and 1787270400000 run from 1905.63 to 2771.00 with closes 2252.16, 2326.32 and 2515.30; the 2771.00 extreme is a spike high with a large upper tail and has not been retested.", "end_time_ms": 1787270400000, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "1905.63", "start_time_ms": 1787097600000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "Trading range after the spike: 29 bars from 1787356800000 to the last bar, bounded by 2357.18 (1788307200000) and the 2680.00 spike high (1789084800000), with heavy overlap, most closes between roughly 2390 and 2540, and an inner ceiling near 2557.46 (1787788800000).", "end_time_ms": 1789862399999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1787356800000, "upper_boundary": "2680"}, {"description": "Two upside spike attempts into the same 2680.00-2700.00 area (1789084800000: high 2680.00, close 2514.72; 1789776000000: high 2700.00, close 2632.98) separated by a sell-off to 2358.62 (1789430400000). The pair is a possible double top at the range high, though the second attempt closes 118 points higher than the first.", "end_time_ms": 1789862399999, "kind": "two-sided", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789084800000, "upper_boundary": "2700"}, {"description": "Two-bar bull leg / breakout attempt: 1789689600000 (open 2446.22, high 2643.52, close 2612.02) and 1789776000000 (open 2612.03, high 2700.00, low 2604.75, close 2632.98). Price lifts above the 2557.46 inner ceiling and prints the window's highest close, but has not yet closed above the 2680.00 range high.", "end_time_ms": 1789862399999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2436.87", "start_time_ms": 1789689600000, "upper_boundary": "2700"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "D1", "transition_conditions": ["Acceptance above the 2680.00 range high, e.g. a close above it followed by another bar closing above 2700.00, would confirm the range breakout and support the bull-trend / breakout-spike read.", "A close back below 2557.46 and into the 2390-2540 range body would negate the breakout attempt and restore an intact trading range between 2357.18 and 2680.00.", "A close below 2357.18 would be a bear breakout from the 29-bar range and would shift the structural read away from the bull flag toward a bear or transition classification.", "Failure to exceed 2680.00 over the next few bars while forming a lower high below 2700.00 would leave the two-sided/double-top interpretation as the strongest alternative and reduce Always-In relevance to low."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}, "H4": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1789905599999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["The window-wide structure is a 2357.18-2700 balance area: about 90% of bars closed between 2380 and 2540, so the 2680 and 2700 highs rest on single spike bars rather than accepted trade.", "Precedent of failure: the 2680 spike (1789128000000) fully retraced to 2358.62 over the next 25 bars, so a strong bull spike into the top of this range has already failed once in the window.", "2700 exceeds 2680 by only 20 points with no close above 2680, and the 61.51-point upper tail on 1789804800000 shows sellers at the high, so the 2680-2700 breakout is unaccepted.", "The pullback already retraced 64.6% of the final 2495.82-2700 spike segment, and 1789862400000 is the largest single-bar decline of the leg, with three lower highs on the last three bars.", "The pullback has not yet produced a bull reversal bar, so nothing in the final bars confirms that the 2358.62 bull leg is resuming rather than topping."], "evidence_for": ["One-sided 22-bar advance (2358.62 to 2700, +14.5%) with four successively higher swing lows and no close beneath the prior swing low.", "The advance absorbed the whole 2357-2540 balance area; 12 consecutive closes above 2540 form acceptance above the old range top rather than a single-bar poke.", "Pullbacks inside the leg stayed shallow and short (1789660800000-1789675200000 held above 2436.87), the signature of a channel instead of a two-sided range.", "The current pullback low 2568.16 has not violated the breakout zone top 2537.57 or the leg midpoint 2529.31, so the breakout point is still intact.", "Spike bars 1789732800000 (close 2578.60) and 1789747200000 (close 2636.28) show urgent buying with follow-through into 2700."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["120 closed H4 bars, first open_time 1788177600000, last open_time 1789891200000; window extremes are low 2357.18 (1788336000000) and high 2700 (1789804800000).", "Near-identical lows 2357.18 (1788336000000) and 2358.62 (1789488000000) sit roughly 80 bars apart, forming a wide double bottom beneath the window.", "Bars with open_time 1788177600000 through 1789704000000 all closed between 2379.67 and 2555.52; the last 12 bars (1789732800000-1789891200000) all closed above 2540, the prior balance-area top.", "1789128000000: open 2457.12, high 2680, low 2444.19, close 2555.52 (235.81 range, 124.48 upper tail); that 2680 high fully retraced to 2358.62 within 25 bars.", "1789804800000: open 2626.53, high 2700 (round number), low 2622.67, close 2638.49; upper tail 61.51 versus body 11.96, and no bar in the window closed above 2680.", "Bull leg from 2358.62 (1789488000000) to 2700 (1789804800000) = 341.38 points (+14.5%) with rising swing lows 2436.87 (1789689600000), 2495.82 (1789732800000), 2622.67 (1789804800000).", "Final three bars (1789862400000, 1789876800000, 1789891200000): closes 2586.68, 2576.90, 2577.88; highs 2633.05, 2586.73, 2585.20 (three lower highs); lows 2569.80, 2570, 2568.16.", "1789862400000 is the largest single-bar decline of the leg (open 2632.98 to close 2586.68, 63.25 range) with the close in the bottom 27% of its range; the next two bars are small overlapping bodies.", "Pullback low 2568.16 is 38.6% of the 2358.62-2700 leg but 64.6% of the final 2495.82-2700 spike segment; it still holds above the leg midpoint 2529.31 and the 2537.57 pre-breakout top (1788508800000)."], "phase": "channel", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Window-dominant two-sided balance from the 2357.18 low (1788336000000) to the 2700 high (1789804800000); nearly all closes sit between 2379.67 and 2555.52, and both extremes are single spike bars (2680 at 1789128000000, 2700 at 1789804800000).", "end_time_ms": 1789891200000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1788177600000, "upper_boundary": "2700"}, {"description": "Bull channel/leg from the 2358.62 low (1789488000000) to the 2700 high (1789804800000), +341.38 points, with rising swing lows 2436.87, 2495.82 and 2622.67; pullbacks inside the leg are shallow and brief, and the leg ends with a two-bar spike (1789732800000, 1789747200000) plus a long-tailed high.", "end_time_ms": 1789804800000, "kind": "channel", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789488000000, "upper_boundary": "2700"}, {"description": "Three-bar bear pullback off the high (1789862400000-1789891200000): three lower highs from 2633.05 to 2585.20, closes 2586.68/2576.90/2577.88, and a 2568.16 low that stays above the leg midpoint 2529.31 and the 2537.57 pre-breakout top.", "end_time_ms": 1789891200000, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "2568.16", "start_time_ms": 1789862400000, "upper_boundary": "2633.05"}, {"description": "Candidate reversal pattern, not a confirmed reversal: two-legged rally to 2680 (1789128000000) then to a 20-point higher high 2700 (1789804800000) at a round number with a 61.51-point upper tail; the earlier 2680 spike retraced fully to 2358.62 and no close has printed above 2680.", "end_time_ms": 1789891200000, "kind": "mtr-like", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789128000000, "upper_boundary": "2700"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "H4", "transition_conditions": ["Bull channel reinforced: a bar closes above 2700, or the pullback ends with a bull reversal bar closing above 2633.05 while 2568.16 holds.", "Range read restored: closes back below 2540 and then below 2495.82 (1789732800000 low) would put price back inside the old balance area and void the breakout.", "Bull leg broken: consecutive closes below 2436.87 (1789689600000 low) would break the leg's last higher low and turn pressure back toward 2358.62.", "MTR-like reversal becomes structural: a lower high below 2680 followed by a close below 2537.57, or a close below 2568.16 that is not recovered within two bars.", "Window double bottom fails if any bar closes below 2357.18."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "stale"}}, "raw": {"H1": [{"close": "2421.99", "close_time_ms": 1789491599999, "high": "2424.28", "low": "2415.14", "open": "2423.22", "open_time_ms": 1789488000000, "volume": "2248462.627"}, {"close": "2440.27", "close_time_ms": 1789495199999, "high": "2442.15", "low": "2412.47", "open": "2422.25", "open_time_ms": 1789491600000, "volume": "2279307.963"}, {"close": "2401.73", "close_time_ms": 1789498799999, "high": "2441", "low": "2358.62", "open": "2440.65", "open_time_ms": 1789495200